1358"],"original_text":"主要/（次要）\n血脂目標值","nested_table_ids":[],"xml_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:tbl[2]/w:tr[1]/w:tc[4]"},{"cell_id":"給付規定-table-0002-r1c5","row":1,"column":5,"column_span":1,"row_span":1,"vertical_merge":null,"merge_anchor_cell_id":null,"paragraph_ids":["給付規定-p001359"],"original_text":"處方規定","nested_table_ids":[],"xml_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:tbl[2]/w:tr[1]/w:tc[5]"}]},{"row":2,"cells":[{"cell_id":"給付規定-table-0002-r2c1","row":2,"column":1,"column_span":1,"row_span":1,"vertical_merge":null,"merge_anchor_cell_id":null,"paragraph_ids":["給付規定-p001360"],"original_text":"極高風險","nested_table_ids":[],"xml_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:tbl[2]/w:tr[2]/w:tc[1]"},{"cell_id":"給付規定-table-0002-r2c2","row":2,"column":2,"column_span":1,"row_span":2,"vertical_merge":"restart","merge_anchor_cell_id":null,"paragraph_ids":["給付規定-p001361"],"original_text":"處置各項可改善心血管風險因子與藥物治療並行","nested_table_ids":[],"xml_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:tbl[2]/w:tr[2]/w:tc[2]"},{"cell_id":"給付規定-table-0002-r2c3","row":2,"column":3,"column_span":1,"row_span":1,"vertical_merge":null,"merge_anchor_cell_id":null,"paragraph_ids":["給付規定-p001362"],"original_text":"LDL-C≧55mg/dL ","nested_table_ids":[],"xml_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:tbl[2]/w:tr[2]/w:tc[3]"},{"cell_id":"給付規定-table-0002-r2c4","row":2,"column":4,"column_span":1,"row_span":1,"vertical_merge":null,"merge_anchor_cell_id":null,"paragraph_ids":["給付規定-p001363"],"original_text":"LDL-C<55mg/dL(non-HDL-C<85mg/dL)","nested_table_ids":[],"xml_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:tbl[2]/w:tr[2]/w:tc[4]"},{"cell_id":"給付規定-table-0002-r2c5","row":2,"column":5,"column_span":1,"row_span":2,"vertical_merge":"restart","merge_anchor_cell_id":null,"paragraph_ids":["給付規定-p001364","給付規定-p001365","給付規定-p001366","給付規定-p001367"],"original_text":"極高、非常高風險：\n一、起始治療：依據基線血脂值、用藥史和臨床狀況，給予中至高強度statin或合併ezetimibe。\n二、經起始治療6~8週後，檢測血脂指標，如治療達標，則維持治療，並應每6個月追蹤血脂指標；如血脂值未達標，檢視服藥狀況，並考慮調整至高強度statin或最大耐受statin劑量，同時考慮合併non-statin治療，包含：ezetimibe、PCSK9單株抗體、siRNA、ATP citrate lyase抑制劑。\n三、更動治療1~3個月內需追蹤血脂值是否達標，如治療達標，則維持治療，並應每6個月追蹤血脂指標；如血脂值未達標，檢視服藥狀況，並考慮調整藥物組合。","nested_table_ids":[],"xml_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:tbl[2]/w:tr[2]/w:tc[5]"}]},{"row":3,"cells":[{"cell_id":"給付規定-table-0002-r3c1","row":3,"column":1,"column_span":1,"row_span":1,"vertical_merge":null,"merge_anchor_cell_id":null,"paragraph_ids":["給付規定-p001368"],"original_text":"非常高風險","nested_table_ids":[],"xml_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:tbl[2]/w:tr[3]/w:tc[1]"},{"cell_id":"給付規定-table-0002-r3c2","row":3,"column":2,"column_span":1,"row_span":1,"vertical_merge":"continue","merge_anchor_cell_id":"給付規定-table-0002-r2c2","paragraph_ids":["給付規定-p001369"],"original_text":"","nested_table_ids":[],"xml_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:tbl[2]/w:tr[3]/w:tc[2]"},{"cell_id":"給付規定-table-0002-r3c3","row":3,"column":3,"column_span":1,"row_span":1,"vertical_merge":null,"merge_anchor_cell_id":null,"paragraph_ids":["給付規定-p001370"],"original_text":"LDL-C≧70mg/dL","nested_table_ids":[],"xml_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:tbl[2]/w:tr[3]/w:tc[3]"},{"cell_id":"給付規定-table-0002-r3c4","row":3,"column":4,"column_span":1,"row_span":1,"vertical_merge":null,"merge_anchor_cell_id":null,"paragraph_ids":["給付規定-p001371"],"original_text":"LDL-C<70mg/dL(non-HDL-C<100mg/dL)","nested_table_ids":[],"xml_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:tbl[2]/w:tr[3]/w:tc[4]"},{"cell_id":"給付規定-table-0002-r3c5","row":3,"column":5,"column_span":1,"row_span":1,"vertical_merge":"continue","merge_anchor_cell_id":"給付規定-table-0002-r2c5","paragraph_ids":["給付規定-p001372"],"original_text":"","nested_table_ids":[],"xml_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:tbl[2]/w:tr[3]/w:tc[5]"}]},{"row":4,"cells":[{"cell_id":"給付規定-table-0002-r4c1","row":4,"column":1,"column_span":1,"row_span":1,"vertical_merge":null,"merge_anchor_cell_id":null,"paragraph_ids":["給付規定-p001373"],"original_text":"高風險","nested_table_ids":[],"xml_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:tbl[2]/w:tr[4]/w:tc[1]"},{"cell_id":"給付規定-table-0002-r4c2","row":4,"column":2,"column_span":1,"row_span":1,"vertical_merge":null,"merge_anchor_cell_id":null,"paragraph_ids":["給付規定-p001374"],"original_text":"生活型態改變與藥物治療並行","nested_table_ids":[],"xml_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:tbl[2]/w:tr[4]/w:tc[2]"},{"cell_id":"給付規定-table-0002-r4c3","row":4,"column":3,"column_span":1,"row_span":1,"vertical_merge":null,"merge_anchor_cell_id":null,"paragraph_ids":["給付規定-p001375"],"original_text":"LDL-C≧100mg/dL","nested_table_ids":[],"xml_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:tbl[2]/w:tr[4]/w:tc[3]"},{"cell_id":"給付規定-table-0002-r4c4","row":4,"column":4,"column_span":1,"row_span":1,"vertical_merge":null,"merge_anchor_cell_id":null,"paragraph_ids":["給付規定-p001376"],"original_text":"LDL-C<100mg/dL(non-HDL-C<130mg/dL)","nested_table_ids":[],"xml_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:tbl[2]/w:tr[4]/w:tc[4]"},{"cell_id":"給付規定-table-0002-r4c5","row":4,"column":5,"column_span":1,"row_span":4,"vertical_merge":"restart","merge_anchor_cell_id":null,"paragraph_ids":["給付規定-p001377","給付規定-p001378","給付規定-p001379","給付規定-p001380","給付規定-p001381","給付規定-p001382","給付規定-p001383","給付規定-p001384"],"original_text":"高風險：\n一、起始治療：依據基線血脂值與臨床狀況，給予中至高強度statin或合併ezetimibe；同時進行生活型態改變。\n二、經起始治療6~8週後，檢測血脂指標，如治療達標，則維持治療，並應每6個月追蹤血脂指標；如血脂值未達標，檢視服藥狀況，並考慮使用高強度statin或最大耐受statin劑量或同時合併non-statin治療，包含：ezetimibe、PCSK9單株抗體、siRNA、ATP citrate lyase抑制劑。\n三、更動治療1~3個月內需追蹤血脂值是否達標，如治療達標，則維持治療，並應每6個月追蹤血脂指標；如血脂值未達標，檢視服藥狀況，並考慮調整藥物組合。\n中、低風險：\n一、起始治療：進行生活型態改變，並處置心血管風險因子。\n二、經起始治療3~6個月後，檢測血脂指標，如治療達標，則維持治療，並應每6-12個月追蹤血脂指標；如血脂值未達標，給予中強度statin。\n三、中強度statin治療6~8週後追蹤血脂值是否達標，如治療達標，則維持治療，並應每6-12個月追蹤血脂指標；如血脂值未達標，檢視服藥狀況，並可給予高強度statin或最大耐受statin劑量或合併non-statin治療。","nested_table_ids":[],"xml_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:tbl[2]/w:tr[4]/w:tc[5]"}]},{"row":5,"cells":[{"cell_id":"給付規定-table-0002-r5c1","row":5,"column":1,"column_span":1,"row_span":1,"vertical_merge":null,"merge_anchor_cell_id":null,"paragraph_ids":["給付規定-p001385"],"original_text":"中風險","nested_table_ids":[],"xml_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:tbl[2]/w:tr[5]/w:tc[1]"},{"cell_id":"給付規定-table-0002-r5c2","row":5,"column":2,"column_span":1,"row_span":3,"vertical_merge":"restart","merge_anchor_cell_id":null,"paragraph_ids":["給付規定-p001386","給付規定-p001387"],"original_text":"給藥前應有3-6個月\n生活型態改變，並處置心血管風險因子","nested_table_ids":[],"xml_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:tbl[2]/w:tr[5]/w:tc[2]"},{"cell_id":"給付規定-table-0002-r5c3","row":5,"column":3,"column_span":1,"row_span":1,"vertical_merge":null,"merge_anchor_cell_id":null,"paragraph_ids":["給付規定-p001388"],"original_text":"LDL-C≧115mg/dL","nested_table_ids":[],"xml_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:tbl[2]/w:tr[5]/w:tc[3]"},{"cell_id":"給付規定-table-0002-r5c4","row":5,"column":4,"column_span":1,"row_span":1,"vertical_merge":null,"merge_anchor_cell_id":null,"paragraph_ids":["給付規定-p001389"],"original_text":"LDL-C<115mg/dL(non-HDL-C<145mg/dL)","nested_table_ids":[],"xml_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:tbl[2]/w:tr[5]/w:tc[4]"},{"cell_id":"給付規定-table-0002-r5c5","row":5,"column":5,"column_span":1,"row_span":1,"vertical_merge":"continue","merge_anchor_cell_id":"給付規定-table-0002-r4c5","paragraph_ids":["給付規定-p001390"],"original_text":"","nested_table_ids":[],"xml_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:tbl[2]/w:tr[5]/w:tc[5]"}]},{"row":6,"cells":[{"cell_id":"給付規定-table-0002-r6c1","row":6,"column":1,"column_span":1,"row_span":1,"vertical_merge":null,"merge_anchor_cell_id":null,"paragraph_ids":["給付規定-p001391"],"original_text":"低風險","nested_table_ids":[],"xml_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:tbl[2]/w:tr[6]/w:tc[1]"},{"cell_id":"給付規定-table-0002-r6c2","row":6,"column":2,"column_span":1,"row_span":1,"vertical_merge":"continue","merge_anchor_cell_id":"給付規定-table-0002-r5c2","paragraph_ids":["給付規定-p001392"],"original_text":"","nested_table_ids":[],"xml_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:tbl[2]/w:tr[6]/w:tc[2]"},{"cell_id":"給付規定-table-0002-r6c3","row":6,"column":3,"column_span":1,"row_span":1,"vertical_merge":null,"merge_anchor_cell_id":null,"paragraph_ids":["給付規定-p001393"],"original_text":"LDL-C≧130mg/dL","nested_table_ids":[],"xml_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:tbl[2]/w:tr[6]/w:tc[3]"},{"cell_id":"給付規定-table-0002-r6c4","ro